# Dev-only landing page: a fixed URL redirecting to the freshest
# payment_sessions order, so a second macOS user — or a phone, when testing
# Apple Pay — reaches it from one bookmark. Carries an order access token in the
# redirect, so it never gets committed.
public/np-latest.html
